{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-bfee12d210a0f277de16","statement":"Let $\\La$ be a Gelfand-Tsetlin pattern in $\\mathscr{S}_{\\la,\\mu}$, we have\n\n- $d_i(u)\\xiL=\\zeil(u) \\xiL$.\n\n- $d_{m+j}(u)\\xiL=\\zejl(u) \\xiL$.","source_id":"arXiv:2604.25462","cluster":"representation_theory","statement_sha256":"f3f490d958e73adbec8b435fbe70e1129a16bdc03a5e02e5c9123b0056c968cf","kind":"lemma","label":"Lemma 27","ref_key":"lem:zek","name":"","order":24,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.25462","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"6be317c9138164c30aa47ee14fa526a73ac66be915e144fb042815ac3c6611f7","line":1190,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-29T14:23:03+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":140,"math_hints":22}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:2604.25462","title":"Representations of Super Yangians with Gelfand-Tsetlin bases","abstract":"The evaluation homomorphism from the super Yangian $\\mathrm Y(\\mathfrak{gl}_{m|n})$ to the universal enveloping algebra $\\mathrm U(\\mathfrak{gl}_{m|n})$ allows one to regard the $\\mathfrak{gl}_{m|n}$-modules as $\\mathrm Y(\\mathfrak{gl}_{m|n})$-modules. In this paper, we establish necessary and sufficient conditions for simple tensor products of covariant evaluation modules to be tame. We also provide an explicit construction of Gelfand-Tsetlin bases for tensor products of skew modules.","authors":["Vyacheslav Futorny","Zheng Li","Jian Zhang"],"year":"2026","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.25462","cluster":"representation_theory","macros":{"End":"{\\rm{End}\\ts}","ot":"\\otimes","la":"\\lambda","La":"\\Lambda","al":"\\alpha","be":"\\beta","ga":"\\gamma","Ga":"\\Gamma","ka":"\\kappa","si":"\\sigma","ze":"\\zeta","om":"\\omega","ts":"\\,","U":"{\\rm U}","Y":"{\\rm Y}","gl":"\\mathfrak{gl}","h":"\\mathfrak h","sgn":"{\\rm sgn}\\ts","bi"